  m_Name: Carta_IluminacaoLED
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Ilumina\xE7\xE3o LED"
  _titleEn: LED Street Lighting
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "L\xE2mpadas LED gastam menos energia e duram muito mais que as de vapor
    de s\xF3dio da ilumina\xE7\xE3o p\xFAblica antiga, e ruas bem iluminadas parecem
    e s\xE3o mais seguras."
  _summaryEn: LED lamps use less energy and last much longer than the old sodium-vapor
    street lights, and well-lit streets feel and are safer.
  _realWorld: "Muitas cidades brasileiras contrataram parcerias p\xFAblico-privadas
    para trocar a ilumina\xE7\xE3o por LED, pagando a troca com a economia de energia."
  _realWorldEn: Many Brazilian cities have signed public-private partnerships to
    switch to LED lighting, paying for it with the energy savings.
  _tradeOffs: "A troca exige investimento alto no come\xE7o, e luz branca forte demais
    aumenta a polui\xE7\xE3o luminosa."
  _tradeOffsEn: The switch requires a large upfront investment, and overly bright
    white light increases light pollution.
  _sources:
  - Label: US DOE, Solid-State Lighting
    Url: https://www.energy.gov/eere/ssl/solid-state-lighting
  - Label: Lei 11.079/2004, PPPs (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2004-2006/2004/lei/l11079.htm
